  "priorExpiration": "2011-11-09",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2904.03 Allocation of Emission Budgets. Using the methodology specified in Env-A 2904.05, the department shall allocate the allowances in each emission budget determined as specified in Env-A 2904.01 and Env-A 2904.02 to the affected sources on December 31 of each year.\n\nSource. #7888, eff 5-13-03; ss by #9908, INTERIM, eff 5-13-11, EXPIRES: 11-9-11; ss by #10002, eff 10-1-11; ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
